te covariance, Pearson's correlation, and simple linear regression) Tj T* (for two inputs:) Tj T* (>>> x = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]) Tj T* (>>> y = [1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3) Tj T* ET
